# ================================================
# NOTES FOR TEAM
# ================================================
# NEVER commit:
# - .env files (contain secrets)
# - application-local.properties (local overrides)
# - *.key, *.pem files (certificates and private keys)
# - logs/ directory (application logs)
# - Any file with "secret", "password", or "credential" in name
#
# If you accidentally commit a secret:
# 1. Immediately rotate/revoke the secret
# 2. Use git filter-branch or BFG Repo-Cleaner to remove from history
# 3. Force push (if repository is private and team is small)